    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateSelectedTestsAndProofs@1 as the Accelerate-owned hermetic selected-tests-and-proofs run against the PCPR-061 DatasetsContextPack@1 identity, the PCPR-062 Kit current root, the PCPR-063 route CID baguqeerab6vsy7orm6wmxmqbzqh5f57dasnufhgngvh47gw7g3whrkr5smga, and the PCPR-064 patch CID baguqeeraphkktpgmcw2uusnbxlh7wfjblmhzb4oy3u55bbpdsvbt4xwvvb4q. The PatchPlan selection is tests/unit/test_pcpr_013_logic_provider_protocol.py and tests/unit/test_pcpr_014_semantic_apis.py. That selection is incomplete, so full validation fallback is required and was run hermetically. Incremental prover binaries z3, cvc5, lean, and coqtop are missing from the sealed PATH and stay typed unavailable. Model stages are not invoked. A model assertion cannot complete work. DatasetsSelectedTestsAndProofsBinding@1 and KitSelectedTestsAndProofsBinding@1 consume run CID baguqeerazgo2lirhy7hrpa42j227gdpzmi3jl4jdajoz6jzqqx7td6fy7dpa without reminting pack, current-root, route, or patch identities. Live supervisor selected tests, live prover, and START stay typed unavailable. Missing a live Quack-fenced session emits operator-blocking task pcpr-065-operator-live-selected-tests-and-proofs. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
